Package: datakit
Title: Translate Stata Do-Files to R, Line by Line
Version: 3.0.0
Authors@R: person("Jonathan", "Bearak", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jbearak@guttmacher.org")
Description: Data preparation for do-files translated to R, built on
    dtaparser. d[i, name, by = g] := value makes and changes a column of
    a data frame or tibble, as generate, replace and bysort do, under
    R's rules. read_fixed_width() reads fixed-width text, such as the
    National Survey of Family Growth files, through its SAS setup file.
License: GPL-3
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    dtaparser (>= 3.0.0),
    rlang,
    stats,
    utils,
    vctrs
Suggests:
    dplyr,
    haven,
    readstata13,
    RcppTOML,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    tibble
Remotes:
    dtaparser=jbearak/dta-parser/r/dtaparser
Encoding: UTF-8
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
